<title>USA: Lucent Technologies Inc Q2 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Lucent Technologies Inc Q2 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>MURRAY HILL, N.J. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited; Millions of dollars, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>		 March 31,  1997	 March 31,  1996</p>
<p> Shr     profit  $0.10	    loss  $0.16</p>
<p> Net     profit  66		 loss  103</p>
<p> Revs		5,149		    4,577</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  640.3		    636.7</p>
<p>NOTES: Number of outstanding shares for quarter ended March 31, 1996 computed on pro forma basis using 636.7 million shares that were outstanding subsequent to the Initial Public Offering of 112.0 million shares in April 1996 and gives no effect to use of proceedings from the IPO. Weighted average loss per share was $0.20 for quarter ended March 31, 1996 on a weighted average share basis using 524.7 million weighted average shares.</p>
<p>Lucent was formerly owned by AT&amp;T.</p>
</text>
